      <activity id="7eaf8759-fe72-5448-b231-e94fb353ad0c" activityNameId="18386d2d-b409-56f2-8156-d12f6ed9f5e5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Carbon tetrachloride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Carbon tetrachloride, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (APME). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
CAS number: 000056-23-5; 
Formula: CCl4; 
Synonyms: Tetrachloromethane; 
UUID: 0a1033cd-0bf1-3ee9-8942-87d11f4b5b76
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: 5 major European producers
Technology: production by three different routes (methane with chlorine / chlorination of chloromethane / chlorination of higher hydrocarbons)
Time period: date of literature used
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a1033cd-0bf1-3ee9-8942-87d11f4b5b76.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
